      "summary": {
        "unit_id": "hmh07-deps7:003",
        "answer": "Accept dialogbundle and dialogkey. If either is undefined, explicitly return undefined. Otherwise read dynamic field dialogbundle.(dialogkey) into dialogalias. If that result is undefined, use a bare return. Read voiceprefix only after a defined alias; if the prefix is defined, replace alias with voiceprefix+dialogalias. Return the resulting alias. A defined empty or false value is not rejected by a truthiness test. No external state is written; dynamic field and concatenation type semantics remain VM-dependent.",
